      <title>针灸治症：舌症、扁桃腺炎与甲状腺疾病</title>
      <link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-6-3/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 09:02:00 +0800</pubDate><author>124768092@qq.com (AcuHerb)</author>
